Comment: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=45}=== By the shogun of Wano and the pirate Kaido! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,雷藏大人平安無事！
Comment: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=38}=== Sir Raizo is safe! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:48.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 838.55 907.06 l 890.28 974.07 928.22 1043.54 936.6 1099.71 601.6 1070.4 568 833.6)}雷藏大人平安無事！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:48.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1024.15 876.66 l 1075.88 943.67 1113.82 1013.14 1122.2 1069.31 656 1076.8 753.6 803.2)}雷藏大人平安無事！
Comment: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=39}=== Raizo is safe! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,我們絕不會出賣自己的夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=32}=== 我們絕不會出賣自己的夥伴！ ===
